  "contentHtml": "<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&#160;<br>&#160;<br>&#160;<br><a href=\"https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1YtkNaMYaHURwTukcaLJ9ZPpqpsg_GDPpOj1NSqhNr_E\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\"><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1YtkNaMYaHURwTukcaLJ9ZPpqpsg_GDPpOj1NSqhNr_E</span></a></p><div class=\"figure-open\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-ke-type=\"opengraph\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\" data-og-type=\"website\" data-og-title=\"반 배정 프로그램 배포\" data-og-description=\"ABCDEFGHIJKLMNOPQRSTUVWXYZ학번(ID,필수)성명(필수)성별(필수)구반(필수)구번호(필수)동명이인(결과)학급석차계열석차학년석차(필수)점수생년월일보호자전화번호출신학교신반(결과)신번호(결과)신반\" data-og-host=\"docs.google.com\" data-og-source-url=\"https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1YtkNaMYaHURwTukcaLJ9ZPpqpsg_GDPpOj1NSqhNr_E\" data-og-url=\"https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1YtkNaMYaHURwTukcaLJ9ZPpqpsg_GDPpOj1NSqhNr_E/edit?usp=embed_facebook\" data-og-image=\"https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/oSF4S/dJMb9jOhW5s/KQoS9k4IXffKcLDZiWF1W0/img.png?width=1200&amp;height=630&amp;face=0_0_1200_630\"><a href=\"https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1YtkNaMYaHURwTukcaLJ9ZPpqpsg_GDPpOj1NSqhNr_E\" target=\"_blank\" data-source-url=\"https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1YtkNaMYaHURwTukcaLJ9ZPpqpsg_GDPpOj1NSqhNr_E\"><div class=\"og-image\"><img class=\"thumb_img\" src=\"https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/oSF4S/dJMb9jOhW5s/KQoS9k4IXffKcLDZiWF1W0/img.png?width=1200&amp;height=630&amp;face=0_0_1200_630\" alt=\"\" xxxxonerror=\"this.src=&quot;//img1.kakaocdn.net/thumb/C200x200/?fname=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafe_image%2Fcafe_meta_image_190529.png&quot;\"></div><div class=\"og-text\"><p class=\"og-title\">반 배정 프로그램 배포</p><p class=\"og-desc\">ABCDEFGHIJKLMNOPQRSTUVWXYZ학번(ID,필수)성명(필수)성별(필수)구반(필수)구번호(필수)동명이인(결과)학급석차계열석차학년석차(필수)점수생년월일보호자전화번호출신학교신반(결과)신번호(결과)신반</p><p class=\"og-host\">docs.google.com</p></div></a></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&#160;<br><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">1.</span><br><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">남자 전교 1등 1반에<br>남자 전교 2등 2반에<br>.....<br>9개 반이면</span><br><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">여자 전교 1등 9반<br>여자 전교 2등 8반<br>.....</span><br><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">지그재그로 편성되며,</span><br><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">여자번호가 앞번호, <br>남자번호가 뒷번호</span><br><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">가나다순으로 배치되는 프로그램입니다.</span><br>&#160;<br>&#160;<br><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">2. 설치 방법</span></p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/cded79128ffb050257409a65466d939ffe406798\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/cded79128ffb050257409a65466d939ffe406798\" data-origin-width=\"612\" data-origin-height=\"430\"></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">가.</span><br><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">위 링크 들어가셔서</span><br><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">[파일]-[사본 만들기] 클릭해서 가져시면 됩니다.</span><br>&#160;<br>&#160;<br>&#160;<br>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/8f9731df7d49890ae7d0f8e62ebdc349ec3c142d\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/8f9731df7d49890ae7d0f8e62ebdc349ec3c142d\" data-origin-width=\"1616\" data-origin-height=\"249\"></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">나.</span><br><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">필수라고 적힌 빨간색 열은 모두 입력되어 있어야 합니다</span><br><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">[학번]은 일련번호 또는 학번을 넣으시면 됩니다.</span><br>&#160;<br>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/062daaca9e98738bdf91eefe1649797f1f01216a\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/062daaca9e98738bdf91eefe1649797f1f01216a\" data-origin-width=\"674\" data-origin-height=\"265\"></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">다.</span><br><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">[같은 반 배정] 시트의 <u>같은 행에 있는 학생들</u>은 - 모두 같은 반 배치</span><br><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">[타 반 배정] 시트의 <u>같은 행에 있는 학생들</u>은 - 서로 서로 타 반 배치가 됩니다.</span><br>&#160;<br>&#160;<br>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/18d7c229bebe680f3b59ba7d81a5a3deacbc4cd5\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/18d7c229bebe680f3b59ba7d81a5a3deacbc4cd5\" data-origin-width=\"966\" data-origin-height=\"525\"></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\">&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/3e44582b9b3b50a344edf362fb98a3bf2d1e1a9e\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/3e44582b9b3b50a344edf362fb98a3bf2d1e1a9e\" data-origin-width=\"922\" data-origin-height=\"333\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/14c628408217f71a0306e6e2cfd400e8601f18a3\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/14c628408217f71a0306e6e2cfd400e8601f18a3\" data-origin-width=\"411\" data-origin-height=\"301\"></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">라.</span><br><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">모두 입력하셨으면</span><br><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">상단 메뉴 </span><br><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">[반 배정 프로그램] 클릭한 뒤</span><br><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">번호 순대로 클릭하시면 됩니다.</span><br>&#160;<br>&#160;<br>&#160;<br><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">----</span><br><b><span style=\"color: #ee2323;\"><span data-ke-size=\"size23\">테스트</span></span></b><br>&#160;</p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/d969ecaf2d090e5bee545de7b71aff988c45aef9\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"500\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/d969ecaf2d090e5bee545de7b71aff988c45aef9\" data-origin-width=\"936\" data-origin-height=\"445\"></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">위와 같이 <br>버튼 클릭으로<br>64개 타반 배치 요구(제한) 사항을</span><br><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">1개만 이루지 못하고<br>타반배치를 완성해주는 프로그램입니다.</span><br>&#160;<br>&#160;<br>&#160;<br>&#160;<br>&#160;<br>&#160;<br>&#160;<br>&#160;<br>&#160;</p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->",
